# Both images build with the repo root as context (infra/docker-compose.yml: `context: ..`) so
# their Dockerfiles can COPY the shared/ package. Allowlist only what the images need -- the
# root also holds large git-ignored local data (files/, testing/, DB dumps) that must never be
# sent to the docker daemon.
*
!api-service/
!vision-service/
!shared/

# ...and drop local-only content inside the allowed directories.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/files/
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
